            "type": "text",
            "text": "In a sudden burst of growth, you cause a thorned bush to sprout from the ground, lash around, and wither. Any creature in the area takes 1d4 piercing damage with a basic Reflex saving throw."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Until the start of your next turn, the area is difficult terrain and hazardous terrain. Any creature entering the square takes "
          },
          {
            "type": "damage",
            "instances": [
              {
                "formula": "1d4 + ceil(@item.level / 2) - 1",
                "damageType": "piercing"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " damage with a basic Reflex saving throw."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "rule"
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Heightened (+2)",
            "marks": ["strong"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " The initial damage increases by 1d4, and the damage dealt by hazardous terrain increases by 1."
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
